config TEST_ATOMIC_OPERATIONS_C
	bool "Use the atomic operations implemented in C"
	select ATOMIC_OPERATIONS_C
	help
	  Use the atomic operations implemented in C, which zephyr/sys/atomic.h
	  prefers to the compiler builtins: they are functions of their own,
	  which a test can wrap to run something just before an atomic
	  operation of the Host.

source "Kconfig.zephyr"
